{"id":"wb-7-911","name":"乌素图召","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"乌素图召","text":"乌素图召（蒙古语：ᠤᠰᠤᠲᠤ ᠵᠤᠤ，汉语拼音字母：Ûst Jûû），位于内蒙古自治区呼和浩特市回民区，是一座藏传佛教格鲁派寺院。乌素图召是呼和浩特地区的“八小召”之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%8C%E7%B4%A0%E5%9B%BE%E5%8F%AC","revisionId":93285064,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93285064","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/90fb3961d05ff6376e019faf.jpg","title":"Wusutu.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wusutu.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/Wusutu.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"CurtNeiMeng","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Wusutu Temple, Hohhot","width":320,"height":240}}